<title>ESTONIA: BALTIC SHIP REPAIRERS TO SEEK LISTING-REPORT.</title>
<headline>BALTIC SHIP REPAIRERS TO SEEK LISTING-REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltic Ship Repairers said that it is seeking a listing on the Tallinn stock exchange this year, the Aripaev newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are looking for ways to raise extra capital,&quot; the company's CEO, Fjodor Berman, was quoted as saying in the newspaper.</p>
<p>The company has completed the necessary formalities required by the Tallinn stock exchange and expects to be listed this year, the newspaper added.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
